    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc9ba081c36433fa9d81ef8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强击想为另一个姐姐・高尚骏逸\n送上比赛胜利的祝贺，\n但她却说要强击最好别管自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "579565eb2f80c0525ba135b157b544b5d14ab7da3f3ae25dad7a203ff23f2e4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b688eb922d6fe97d492bf61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了不被拿来和姐姐比较而选择了经典三冠，\n但最后又没能参加经典级赛事——\n高尚骏逸如此自嘲道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a51d69fd38b84c9d1abd9a3a290138f8360732ea3ed70b64524dc6d4f18a5de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ff0bce3e529cd0acb20209",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，强击还是信赖着高尚骏逸。\n认为没走极峰开辟的道路，\n而是选择了自己道路的她“很帅气”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "953e944d8e76e8a18b6da3810309eb888aae09e48a45ea1f57b23bef970eb573",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ad9d7486b90178382195a11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在没有传达到的心意，总有一天——\n正这么想着的训练员，\n突然听到了强击咳嗽的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a2b3ac1db8deb6037a65f231d51882d6362837754e593da093c925b037c1515",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
