      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是强击坚决不退让。\n说是三后冠和迪拜都不会放弃，\n二人因她的诉诸而动容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44369d4eefe9942bc77455d7f85338b66e931ff42c42fa4c41a7589766e59b14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
